     "zh": 2020,
     "en": 2090
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "cue2",
    "role": "cue",
    "text": {
     "zh": "四点跪姿，膝盖画一个尽量大的圈，腰不要动",
     "en": "On all fours, draw a big circle with the knee, keep the low back still"
    },
    "ms": {
     "zh": 3947,
     "en": 3762
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "cue3",
    "role": "cue",
    "text": {
     "zh": "膝向侧后方慢慢画大圈",
     "en": "Circle the knee slowly out and back"
    },
    "ms": {
     "zh": 2322,
     "en": 1788
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "side_switch",
    "role": "side_switch",
    "text": {
